{"title":"연민은 사절이라","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=Z8bIy/dJMcajoc4zC/0AbKJIKKKmmwVM1j10kCfk&filename=th3","synopsis":"하루 한 끼를 어떻게 해결해야 할지가 \n가장 고민인 고등학생 강재영. \n몰래 무료 급식소에 가서 끼니를 때우는 것이 그의 비밀이다. \n\n그날도 배를 채우러 급식소에 들른 강재영은\n우연히 근처 명문고 학생 둘의 키스신을 목격한다. \n문제는 그들이 둘 다 남학생이라는 것. \n\n낯부끄러운 장면을 들킨 연민결은 벙찐 강재영에게 \n적반하장으로 화를 내며 돈으로 비밀 엄수를 요구한다. \n\n최악의 첫 만남 이후 어쩐지 계속 마주치게 되는 둘. \n연민결이 거슬리지만 거절하기 힘든 만남이 이어진다.","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":294,"change":{"type":"down","amount":22}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":255,"change":{"type":"up","amount":39}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":263,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":262,"change":{"type":"up","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":259,"change":{"type":"up","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":279,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":247,"change":{"type":"up","amount":32}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":258,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":239,"change":{"type":"up","amount":19}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":284,"change":{"type":"down","amount":45}},{"date":"2026-09-04","rank":264,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-05","rank":269,"change":{"type":"down","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-09-06","rank":269,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-08","rank":296,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-09","rank":258,"change":{"type":"up","amount":37}},{"date":"2026-09-10","rank":267,"change":{"type":"down","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-09-11","rank":258,"change":{"type":"up","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-09-15","rank":283,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-18","rank":277,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-19","rank":255,"change":{"type":"up","amount":22}},{"date":"2026-09-20","rank":274,"change":{"type":"down","amount":19}},{"date":"2026-09-21","rank":297,"change":{"type":"down","amount":23